# Express, security, DNS

One Express 4 process serves API + production SPA. `trust proxy` = 1. Apex is DNS-only, so Express sets CSP / HSTS.

Contact: 5 posts / 15 min, honeypot, Turnstile fail-closed in production except `intent=reminder`. Error JSON is a fixed string. Do not leak SQL, keys, or emails.

`robots.txt` disallows `/checkout/`, `/admin`, `/login`, `/account`, `/api/`.
